; P1b empty-tail trie-join (ours) vs ProductZipper+unify (upstream).
; (p $x) is a STORED atom carrying a VARIABLE at the join position.
; Upstream unifies $a with the stored var, then with `a` -> (out a).
; A byte-exact trie MEET of {$} and {a} is empty -> that match is silently DROPPED.
; (p z)/(q z) is the ground CONTROL: present in both, proves the exec fired.
(p $x)
(q a)
(p z)
(q z)
(exec 0 (, (p $a) (q $a)) (, (out $a)))
